ba3d4158-762c-443d-a117-a4d4c7ff6eb2-2
00:11:30.051 --> 00:11:35.220
discussions of the practice focus on
repetition and the time in between.

ba3d4158-762c-443d-a117-a4d4c7ff6eb2-3
00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:40.885
And so this emphasis was often put on a
