ba3d4158-762c-443d-a117-a4d4c7ff6eb2-5
00:11:45.275 --> 00:11:50.090
that while passive exposure to material
overtime sort of solidifies

d7a0cd48-c7c5-47fe-a309-6e5923d4cf2d-0
