knowledge,
actively struggling to recall information

d7a0cd48-c7c5-47fe-a309-6e5923d4cf2d-1
00:11:54.862 --> 00:11:57.880
actually allows for consolidation.

bd8b53a9-6e39-4eb4-99a6-a787cc151ee2-0
00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.993
That is,
the harder you work to recall information,

bd8b53a9-6e39-4eb4-99a6-a787cc151ee2-1
