bd8b53a9-6e39-4eb4-99a6-a787cc151ee2-2
00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:09.840
the information.
But partially forgetting something and

bd8b53a9-6e39-4eb4-99a6-a787cc151ee2-3
00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:14.290
then struggling to remember it is a
